   For those who complain that the game is too easy how about this track:
try to win without killing monsters. Here's the game I just finished.

Mu the Conjurer           St:18/76 Dx:11 Co:15 In:18 Wi:11 Ch:12  Chaotic
EndLevel G:167 HP:64(110) Pw:20(20) AC:-61 Xp:3/72

You went to your reward with 26394 points,
        a cheap plastic imitation of the Amulet of Yendor (worth 2 zorkmids),
        a cheap plastic imitation of the Amulet of Yendor (worth 2 zorkmids),
and 167 pieces of gold, after 71431 moves.
You were level 3 with a maximum of 110 hit points when you ascended.


